  "notes": "USAGE:\nEmphasizes the speed and magnitude of change. Stronger than {変化|へんか} (change) or {変動|へんどう} (fluctuation). Often appears in news and commentary about society, politics, and technology.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {激変|げきへん}する (to change drastically)\n- {激変|げきへん}を{遂|と}げる (to undergo drastic change)\n- {環境|かんきょう}の{激変|げきへん} (drastic environmental change)\n- {激変|げきへん}{期|き} (period of upheaval)",
